Usa la granata chaff antiradar per
creare interferenza elettronica.
}
//	<<<ENGLISH>>>
//	Use the chaff grenade to set
//	up electronic interference.
//<ページ数変更>
大佐_000_1: {
Il Cypher rimarra fuori uso fino a
quando dura l'interferenza.
}
//	<<<ENGLISH>>>
//	The Cypher will be offline for
//	as long as the chaff is active.

/*チャフ・グレネードを使って電子装置を
