Non stare troppo in acqua -
ti prenderai un raffreddore.
}
//	<<<ENGLISH>>>
//	Don't stay in the water too
//	long. You'll catch cold.

/*水中に長居して風邪を引くなよ。
*/
//dv}//v
}//d

