e le tue nanomacchine organizzeranno
}
//	<<<ENGLISH>>>
//	All you have to do is stop moving
//	for a duration of time and your
//	nanomachines will arrange for＃－
//<ページ数変更>
大佐_001_1: {
la produzione di alte quantit&`a di piastrine
per fermare l'emorragia.
}
//	<<<ENGLISH>>>
//	platelets to be produced in large
//	numbers. The bleeding will stop
//	as a result.

/*一定時間、じっとしていれば体内の
ナノマシンが大量の血小板を作り出して
