//	Raiden, look closely. There are
//	enemies on the demolished
//	connecting bridge.

/*ライデン、よく見ろ。
破壊された連絡橋に敵がいるぞ。
*/
ローズ_001: {
Forse stanno controllando gli effetti
dell'esplosione.
}
//	<<<ENGLISH>>>
//	Maybe they are surveying
//	the extent of the explosion.

/*爆発の影響を調べてるのかしら？
*/
大佐_002: {
Sembra proprio cos&`i.
}
//	<<<ENGLISH>>>
//	Looks like it.

/*そのようだな。*/
//dv}//v
}//d
resource PC_ＬＧ連絡橋＿敵は排除２__i {
